window.products.push({"id":779062,"name":"BBQ Gloves 932°F Heat Resistant Grilling Gloves, Food Grade Grill Gloves, Silicone Non-Slip Oven Gloves for Cooking Grilling Baking Kitchen Gloves ( B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hFtcTCwSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥SAFE HEAT RESISTANT: With authoritative EN407/EN420 certification, triple heat protection technology, this technology keeps you safe from burnt and withstand temperatures of 212℉ up to 932℉. 🔥PREMIUM QUALITY: Our heat resistant gloves consist of 3 layers of different materials and functions. First layer non-toxic silicone for skid resistance. Second layer ultra-high strength aramid fiber for high heat, acid and alkali resistance. Third layer 100% cotton for double protection and comfortable. 🔥FLEXIBLE & ANTI-SLIP: Our heat resistant BBQ gloves are covered with Food Grade Silicone to ensure your object would not slip from your hands.They allow you possible to hold different kinds of hot and slick kitchen item safely and stably. Our gloves are ambidextrous, could be worn left or right. 🔥MULTI-USE: Food grade silicone, ideal for all of your baking, grilling, cooking, barbeque, charcoal, oven, microwave, stove, smoker, dutch oven, fireplace, campfire, hot pots, pans, woodworking and so much more. There is no difference between the right or left hand of our grilling gloves, you can wear on both sides. 🔥Extended wrist guard & Breathable - Our hot resistant baking gloves equipped Ultra-long wrist guard. It will keep your hands, wrists and forearms all be safer. We also Lined with super soft cotton to breathe, so there is enough air circulation to let your hands won't sweat in summer or high heat condition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hFtcTCwSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Charmyth","source_asin":"B0912JK6N8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779062","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0912JK6N8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0912JK6N8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
