window.products.push({"id":779081,"name":"Decoberry Farmhouse Curtains for Living Room - Partial Blackout Curtains 63 Length, Mertie Blue, 100% Cotton Curtains, Semi Sheer Curtains, Set of 2-5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vavo5lgJS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Made from 100% soft and pure cotton threads, Mertie Check will dress your room up or down with a traditional 2-inch by 2-inch powder blue and off-white check pattern. The fabric is extremely soft to touch and resistant to wear and tear. Mertie is a traditional farmhouse design curtain with great thickness and an elegant fall. The plain weave fabric has a classic buffalo check, gingham style. Set includes two 52\" X 63\" panels. Partial Blackout Curtains: These luxury curtains are made with a unique 100% cotton liner that adds to their beauty. It blocks 50-60% of light creating an atmosphere of radiance and tranquility. Its translucence lets you feel the shimmering sunlight but it is opaque enough to guarantee your privacy. MULTIPLE SIZES AND GENEROUS WIDTH: The width of each panel is 52” wide which means with a set of 2 curtains you should be able to cover most of the common sized window panels in your home. We offer multiple lengths of curtains for you to make the best choice for your home. MANUFACTURING PROCESS: Exceptional quality at affordable prices is the single most powerful driving factor in our manufacturing process. The curtains are created by craftsmen with generations of experience. These curtains are generously hemmed and machine stitched to ensure both quality and efficiency. Our fabrics are low maintenance as they are manufactured for all types of climates. The industrial woven fabric is also moist-resistant and maintains its sturdiness under hazardous conditions. BACK-TAB AND ROD POCKET HEADING: Mertie Check utilizes a unique combination of both back tab and rod pocket headings for the curtain. The two hanging options help break the monotony and give the added advantage of an alternate look as a pleasant option for the user.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vavo5lgJS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decoberry","source_asin":"B08V99GMJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V99GMJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V99GMJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
