window.products.push({"id":779159,"name":"hatisan Canvas Tote Bag for Women, Strong Canvas Bag Reusable Grocery Shopping Cloth Bags with Handles, Grocery Bags Reusable Shopping Bags for Grocer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VaqpCItkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Need a great high quality multipurpose cotton reusable tote bags? Shopping canvas bags with handles are the best choice for going out, 100% cotton and linen materials using natural unbleached cotton fabrics, eco-friendly, non-toxic and non-polluting.The most important question in the world today is pollution, it’s everyone’s duty to love and protect the environment. Reduce to use the plastic bag for shopping, which is an easy way we can make it, our canvas shopping bags is one of good choices for replacement, let’s make our home become much more beautiful. CUTE TOTE BAGS FOR WOMEN A group of adept handicraft workers and excellent management team can control the size tolerance of +/-0.5\". High-class cotton fabrics and cotton linen are selected, we are committed to bring the best reusable grocery tote bags to our customers. HEAVY DUTY REUSABLE GROCERY BAGS FOLDABLE Made of 100% 12oz cotton canvas and cotton linen, with heavy weight stitching throughout, including double-stitching at the handles for maximum strength allowing the cotton tote bags to hold up extra bearing capacity, that’s the reason that we can promise that if any bag under normal use conditions is broken within 1 year, a free replacement will be offered. Its color design with beautiful patten our plain canvas tote bags simple but elegant. LARGE CANVAS BAG/REUSABLE BAGS WITH HANDLES The volume of the washable grocery bags is about 16L and can hold more than 33lbs. The totes bags is comfortable whenever it is carried in hand and worn over the shoulders. The handles in 1.4\" width, can effectively relieve muscle pain when it is on burden. Great for grocery shopping, carrying school books, art supplies, laptops or tablets, office supplies, etc. MULTIPURPOSE - CLOTH TOTE BAG / CLOTH SHOPPING BAGS Reuseable shopping bags great for beach, picnic, party, gym, library, birthday gifts, trade shows, conference, Christmas gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VaqpCItkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hatisan","source_asin":"B08T777W2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T777W2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T777W2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":779160,"name":"First Day of School Chalkboard, Easy to Clean Reusable Sign with Wooden Ruler Frame, Pink Crayon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nXGqHV4kL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"First Day of School Chalkboard Sign with Wooden Ruler Frame First Day of School Chalkboard Sign with Wooden Ruler Frame Works with Chalk and most Chalk Markers- Easy to Clean! Works with Chalk and most Chalk Markers- Easy to Clean! Handmade in the USA Handmade in the USA Perfect for First day of Kindergarten, Pre K, and beyond! Perfect for First day of Kindergarten, Pre K, and beyond! Approximately 11.5\" x 15\" Approximately 11.5\" x 15\" Take the cutest pictures ever with this First Day of School Chalkboard! It is reusable and can be used every year, from the first day of Pre K or Kindergarten to the first day of high school. It works with most chalk markers and regular chalk, and is easy to clean. The years between your child's first day and graduating high school will go by in the blink of an eye! Don't miss out on the memories of the first day, year after year. At approximately 15\" x 11.5\" our sign is the perfect size for photos, and is great to show how your little one grows each year. It is handmade in the USA and due to the nature of handmade items varies slightly from board to board. The wooden rulers feature variations in the wood grain that may result in darker sections, and/or lines in the wood. This is part of the charm of using real wood, and is to be expected. Use and Care: Our chalkboards work with regular chalk and most chalk markers. We suggest wiping it with a damp rag with just water, and following up with a dry rag (especially if using chalk markers). A magic eraser can remove any chalk marker residue or more stubborn chalk markers. We do not suggest \"priming\" the chalkboard if you are using regular chalk- it is already ready to go! Please Note: No other items are included with this purchase.  Only the framed chalkboard sign is included. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nXGqHV4kL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BloomOwl","source_asin":"B07VLHF1YY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VLHF1YY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VLHF1YY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
