window.products.push({"id":779168,"name":"GLACER Floor Storage Cabinet, Multifunctional Freestanding Bathroom Storage Cabinet with Two Adjust Shelves, Ideal for Bathroom, Living Room or Bedroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XbYInTUIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[A Sleek and Efficient Storage Solution]: Introducing a stylish bathroom floor cabinet in a sleek black finish, designed to keep your space organized and clutter-free. With a spacious drawer and a concealed lower cabinet, this floor cabinet offers ample storage space while taking up minimal floor space. The cabinet's simple design allows it to blend seamlessly into any decor, while adding a touch of sophistication to your space. [Quality Painting and Durable Construction]: This floor cabinet has been crafted with care, using waterproof painting to ensure its suitability for daily use in the bathroom. It serves as an ideal storage solution for all your bathroom essentials. To enhance its strength and stability, the cabinet has been constructed using premium P2 MDF material. This combination of quality materials and reliable construction guarantees that this floor cabinet will last for years to come. [Something Minor but Important]: Designed with safety in mind, this cabinet is equipped with an anti-toppling device to prevent it from tipping over easily in the event of accidental knocks, making it ideal for households with children or pets. The cabinet also features adjustable shelves, offering versatile storage options. The upper shelf can be adjusted to three different positions, with a 2.5-inch space between each, while the lower shelf can be adjusted to four positions. [Easy to Assemble & Maintain]: The bathroom storage cabinet comes with a comprehensive step-by-step instruction manual and all necessary hardware, allowing for a hassle-free setup process. Keeping it clean is also a breeze thanks to its smooth lacquered surface that makes it easy to remove stains and maintain its pristine appearance. [GLACER Promise]: We are committed to delivering high-quality products that meet your expectations. If for any reason you are not satisfied with your floor cabinet, we are here to help. Simply reach out to us and we will respond within 24 hours with feasible suggestions to resolve any issue. Your happiness and complete satisfaction is our top priority, and we will do everything in our power to make things right for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XbYInTUIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLACER","source_asin":"B08QMJF5Q5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QMJF5Q5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QMJF5Q5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
