window.products.push({"id":779200,"name":"Indoor Grill Smokeless 1800W Electric BBQ Grills Outdoor Korean Raclette Table Top Design with Metal Drip Tray Griddle Adjustable Temperature Control ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HVkxqwkaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Electric BBQ Grill Indoor] - The electric indoor grill has a power of 1800W with no grill lid design, allow us to watch the cooking and turn over the food at any time, which offer you a real barbecue experience when you BBQ inside or outdoor. The 3U-shaped heating tube has a larger heating area, so that the food is heated evenly and good to keep locked the moisture and nutrition of the food [Safe Tabletop Grill Design] - Adjustable Temperature, and the thermostat can automatically keep the temperature constant not exceed 260 ℃/500℉ when continuous cooking, and the heating pipes of the raclette table grill has been passed high temperature explosion proof tested, and the 51inch (130cm) power cord also is long enough for use on the dining table [Healthy Cooking Smokeless Grill Design] - Combined with food grade grill nets, drip trays and recessed design grill body, which is material safe,and compared to charcoal grills, the electric grill is smokeless, only need clean water instead, easy use and without harmful smoke when cooking, good to protect the nutrition and taste of food (PLEASE ALWAYS ADD WATER and DO NOT OVER the top line on to avoid overheating or boiling, and it is normal that food itself produce water vapor during heating) [Detachable and Easy to Clean] - The korean bbq grill electric indoor is detachable and each part can be easily assembled and disassembled, which is very convenient for cleaning up the remaining oil (Notice: please do not flush the thermostat with water.) [Ideal size for indoor and outdoor Barbecue] - The small grill is 15.2 x 9.6 inch, which is suitable for 2 to 5 people. The portable grill size design is an ideal choice when you need to BBQing indoor or outdoor. Such as office, home, backyard, garden, camping accessories for family party or other party to celebrate Christmas, Halloween, or other festivals, and it is also a good grilling gifts for men and grill gifts for dad for Father's Day, and good idea for Mother's Day","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HVkxqwkaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TONZE","source_asin":"B093B85FC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093B85FC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093B85FC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":779201,"name":"National Tree Company Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Hanging Basket, Mountain Spruce, Decorated With Frosted Pine Cones, Berry Clusters, White Lights, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zh1u2PiwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform your home for the winter holidays with National Tree Company's Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Hanging Basket Decoration. Designed with a Mountain Spruce branch base, this hanging basket is 20 inches wide and decorated with pine cones and frosted branches. These beautifully ornate decorations complement the basket's natural looking branches. Hundreds of crush-resistant polyethylene tips form full bodied branches to create a hanging basket with remarkable realism. This fantastically festive hanging basket decoration is strung with white LED lights prior to packaging for a more convenient setup. The lights operate individually, so if the bulb lens has not been cracked or broken, the light set will continue to illuminate except for any individual bulbs that are not working. To power the lights, simply place three AA batteries into the battery pack and let the pre strung lights illuminate your home with the warmth and cheer of the holiday season. Hang this decorative basket over any door, window or mantle to bring a Christmas ambience into any room or covered porch. Constructed with sturdy, high quality materials and hypo-allergenic, fire-resistant needles, this basket is built to bring holiday cheer for years to come. This hanging decoration is suitable for both indoor and covered outdoor use. At National Tree Company, we strive to create high quality Christmas decorations to help you transform your home so you can keep making every holiday moment magical.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zh1u2PiwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"National Tree Company","source_asin":"B00N9VU4KS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N9VU4KS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N9VU4KS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
