window.products.push({"id":779233,"name":"Halloween Balloon Arch Garland Kit - Spooky Decorations & Supplies Set for Scary Themed Parties - PVC Bat Decor, 16ft Decorating Garland Strip, Glue D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71poE9zTKiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a way to spruce up your indoor Halloween decorations? Planning your outdoor Halloween decorations can be tons of fun. From perfectly carved Jack-O-Lanterns to giant skeletons in your lawn and bats hanging in trees or porch, there are plenty of fun decorating ideas to scare both trick-or-treaters and your neighbors. But don't forget about your interiors, too! After all, if you're planning to host a Halloween party, then you'll want the inside of your house to be just as festive as the outside. But what decoration should you use? This 92-Piece Halloween Balloon Arch Garland Kit is a boo-tiful addition to your Halloween decor! This balloon arch kit has everything you need to make a grand and spooky Halloween garland. The balloons come in different colors, sizes, and designs. Some have polka dots, confetti, bats, and ghost prints on them, while others are plain with solid colors. There's also a \"BOO\" foil balloon to add a nice finishing touch to your arch's design. The latex balloons can be air-filled if you're attaching them to the arch. However, if you want to leave some of them floating separately, then you can fill them with helium. The \"BOO\" foil balloon can only be air-filled. This Halloween arch can also be used in other settings. They're perfect for office parties or school activities, or you can use them for festivals or as a backdrop for a photoshoot! What’s included: - 40 pcs 12” latex balloons - 5 pcs Halloween balloons in random colors and patterns - 5 pcs 12” Halloween confetti balloons - 5 pcs 12” Polka dot balloons - 20 pcs 5” Balloons - 1 pc BOO Foil Balloons - 12 pcs 3D Bat sticker - 16ft Balloon Strip - 20 pcs Glue Dots Make your house extra fun and spooky this year. Add the 92-Piece Halloween Balloon Arch Garland Kit to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71poE9zTKiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koite","source_asin":"B09CY4YTMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CY4YTMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CY4YTMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
