window.products.push({"id":779301,"name":"Gwane 96L Collapsible Laundry Basket with 4 Detachable Brackets, Thick Waterproof Lining, Large Square Laundry Hamper for Bathroom, Bedroom, Clothing,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PMkt2ahaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Large Capacity】: The clothes hamper has a large capacity of 96L, and the overall size is 17.7x13.9x23.6 inches. It can easily accommodate multiple pieces of clothes and help you solve the problem of storing dirty clothes. Don't worry about the changed clothes everywhere on the sofa or bed. It is enough for a family to use, and it is also very suitable for universities and dormitories. ✅【Reinforcement Material】: The upgraded laundry hamper has 4 sturdy detachable rods. Thanks to the foldable and detachable bracket, it can stand independently and stay upright for a long time without annoying collapse, so as to accommodate more clothes and is also very convenient to use! ✅【High-quality Fabric】: The wash basket is equipped with practical cotton and linen handles, which are firm and reliable, and will not come loose, which is convenient for the washing bag to go up and down the stairs. There is a waterproof coating on the inside to keep the stored items dry and easy to clean. Just wipe it with a damp sponge or damp cloth. Do not use the washing machine to clean the dirty laundry basket directly, as this will damage the coating. ✅【Foldable Design】: The collapsible function of the laundry basket is very suitable for travel or home storage, and can be folded to save space when not in use. Assembly is also very simple! Just open the package, let the folded laundry basket unfold, and then install the support bar. ✅【Multi-function】: This foldable laundry hamper has powerful functions, suitable for storing shoes, clothes, toys, books, etc., and can be used in bathrooms, bedrooms, living rooms, laundry rooms, dormitories and children's rooms. Provide you a clean and warm home! If you have any questions, you can contact our customer service to solve it for you at any time！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PMkt2ahaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gwane","source_asin":"B096DHV898","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779301","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096DHV898","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096DHV898","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":779302,"name":"SIUMUN Natural Bamboo Steamer Set - 10\" - Handmade Cookware, 2-Tier Basket Included 2 Pair of Chopsticks, 2 Cotton Liners & Sauce Dish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L6+v7jKnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<b>BENEFITS OF STEAMING:</b> Cook and reheat your foods naturally while sealing in the nutrients using the SIUMUN Bamboo Steamer. Unlike boiling, which can drain foods of its nutrients, steaming helps food retain its vitamins and minerals, as well as its color, making it a healthier way of cooking, in an all-natural vessel. Ideal cookware for steaming dim sum, dumplings, vegetables, rice, chicken, fish etc. <b>STURDY BAMBOO CONSTRUCTION: </b> This set is crafted from 100% natural sustainable bamboo and contains no metal in its construction. Unlike metal steamers, bamboo is an extremely effective steaming material due to its ability to absorb condensation. Its body features neatly fitted bottom slats, which along with its tightly hand-woven lid, ensures your foods are properly steamed for optimal flavor. <b>TWO-TIERED DESIGN: </b> This set includes (2) 10\" steamer bodies and (1) 10\" lid, allowing you cook foods with different cook times in the same vessel, on the same burner. This effectively reduces the amount of pans used and space needed to prepare your dishes, providing you with an easy and convenient cooking option at a great value! <b>A CINCH TO CLEAN: </b> Bamboo steamer should be washed with warm water and a mild detergent by hand, not in a dishwasher. Let them air-dry thoroughly before storing them in a dry, ventilated area. Make sure it's completely dry before storing, though you may as well keep it on your countertop¡ªthat's how often you're going to be using it. <b>COURTESY GIFT: </b> Our steamer set includes 2 sets of bamboo chopsticks, 1 x Asian style dipping sauce plate and 2 x reusable cotton fabric liners all packed in a dedicated kraft paper bag. Enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L6+v7jKnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIUMUN","source_asin":"B08BNL7FCY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779302","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BNL7FCY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BNL7FCY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
