window.products.push({"id":779324,"name":"Sunflower Throw Blanket,You Are My Sunshine Flannel Fleece Blanket,Soft Cozy Fuzzy Warm Lightweight Blanket for Mom,Daughter-Couch, Bed,Sofa Microfibe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NEaKTH4PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WELCOME TO LOVE - HOME Our ultra soft blanket have a you are my sunshine sunflower gray pattern to complement your room, they are perfect addition to any home decor like on the couch, end of bed.Enjoy your family happy hours and movie night with plush and warm blanket on the sofa, bed - Bring extra soft and comfort for an afternoon nap in bed covering with our fleece blanket - Perfect for indoor and outdoor picnic use to provide warmth in chilly weather.It is a good choice for household, office. The comfort luxury snuggle blanket is the perfect gift for everyone! Soft Fleece Blankets Specification Materiel:100% 330GSM microfiberLength:60 inchWidth:50 inch Main Features 1.330GSM furry blanket is just the weight to stay breathable enough that you won't get hot or sweat like a quilt or comforter does in summer and be warm enough for winter use. More light weight and fluffier feeling than ordinary cotton throw blanket.2.Double side with soft fur offers you different soft with one side of smooth and fuzzy to the other.3.100% microfiber polyester blanket can stand up to washing and drying for years without pilling, fading, wrinkling, shedding or shrinking.4.This funny blanket can be used as couch blanket, sofa blanket, bed blanket, nap blanket, chair blanket, sleep blanket and travel blanket.5.Neat stitches enhance strong connections at seams and better strength with integrated outlook.6. Micro fleece blanket is perfect for folks who are sensitive to the scaling of wool fibers. Warm Notice 1.Due to hand cut and hand controlled sewing, there may be about 0.1-0.2 inch error. This will not affect daily use.2.Do not bleach, machine washed; tumble or line dry.3.Due to monitor differences, actual color may vary slightly from what appears on your monitor's display.4.If you have an questions with throw blanket, please send us message!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NEaKTH4PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Love - Home","source_asin":"B08LG6R6Y2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LG6R6Y2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LG6R6Y2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":779325,"name":"Sesame Street Character Collectible Mugs (Grover)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XLbPJg6DL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Tumbler color - BLACK Our Black color Tumbler Mug has a modern design with a surface that has a pleasant tactile sensation to it, making it comfortable and convenient to hold. This mug was simply designed to be a life-long travel buddy. Our goal is to produce quality tumblers with a simple and smart design. We strive to satisfy your needs with the range of our quality products, which include insulated tumblers, bottles, cups and thermoses. You’ll be sure to ENJOY A CLEAN AND FRESH TASTE of your favorite drink from OUR stainless steel tumblers. No matter what climate you’re traveling in, our Tumblers are sure to contain the heat of your hot drink on your alpine hiking trips in the mountains or the keep your cold drink cool on your Sahara desert expeditions. Our Tumbler Mug was designed for: -Casual road trips -Hiking or backpacking trips -Hot days on the beach -Alpine hiking on snowy mountains -Also great for just drinking water -Your favorite smoothies -Mothers feeding their kids Our Tumbler Mugs were designed with the following features: - Designed with split proof lid that can be opened with one finger (The split proof lid is sealed with silicone keeping it air tight) - Lid is made with a durable plastic Our Tumbler Mugs have great additional features for keeping your life simple: -Designed with a hole on the magnetic lid, making sipping or fitting straws in convenient -Designed to fit any cup holder in your car Technological Features of our Tumbler Mugs include: - Designed to keep hot beverages hot for up to 6 hours - Designed to keep cold drinks cool for up 24 hours - Made with SEAMLESS Inner and outer DESIGN - Made from a DURABLE STAINLESS STEEL 18/8 - Produces no condensation - Made BPA free and from a non-toxic material, which is eco-friendly - Designed with a durable scratch proof Powder coating - Dishwash safe Dimensions: Diameter of lid: 3 1/2 inches Height: 6 7/8 inches Diameter of bottom: 6 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XLbPJg6DL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wave","source_asin":"B079NSGTFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079NSGTFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079NSGTFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
