window.products.push({"id":779449,"name":"5 in 1 Candle Accessory Set,Candle Wick Trimmer Cutter,Candle Wick Dipper,Candle Wick Snuffer,Rechargeable Candle Lighter,Tweezers,Stainless Steel Can","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q-YZpRqQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁 CANDLE ACCESSORY SET: Candle Wick Trimmer Set which includes candle wick cutter,candle wick snuffer, candle wick dipper, tweezers and Electric Candle Lighter in an elegant velvet gift bag. Candle Care Tools Accessory kit Candle Snuffer Set could help you extinguish the candle easily and gracefully, bring good mood for you. 🎁 USB RECHARGEABLE CANDLES LIGHTER: The Arc Lighter with 360°Rotatable Neck can be bend to any angle you want to meet different applications,The eco-friendly candle lighter with powerful USB rechargeable Li-ion battery can be recirculated 500 times. Electric lighter designs flameless make it 100% windproof, you will be able to use and get it to light up the candle,protects you and your family from burns. 🎁 CANDLE SNUFFER AND WICK TRIMMER: Wick cutter a long handle and comfortable design, which means that you can cut and maintain your wicks at a safe burning length of 1/4”. The swivel head of the snuffler allows the candle to be quickly extinguished，keep the snuffer just above the flame to snuff it out with minimal smoke and to prevent wax flying off tip of candle. 🎁 CANDLE WICK DIPPER AND TWEEZERS: Use the wick dipper to push the wick over into the wax and snuff. This coats and seals the wick, preventing smoking and smoldering. The tweezers allows you to move a shifted wick, and carefully remove debris. 🎁 PERFECT GIFT IDEA: The wick trimmer package include the candle wick trimmer is 7 inches long,the candle snuffer is 8.9 inches long, the wick dipper is 7.9 inches long, the tweezers 4.9 inches and 10.4 inches long electric candlelighter.Beautifully crafted candle accessory set any candle lover would be thrilled to receive. Item is as functional as it is beautiful, and comes in a sturdy box and velvet black gift bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q-YZpRqQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HEYLOURB","source_asin":"B09XPZLN5P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XPZLN5P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XPZLN5P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
