window.products.push({"id":779540,"name":"LINICE Canvas Grocery Bags Reusable Shopping Bags Heavy Duty Tote Bag Foldable Washable with Handles Blank Beach Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512pYLJOg5L._AC_UL1001_.jpg","description":"canvas Imported Cotton lining Hand Wash Only 【Durable Material】: The shoulder canvas tote bag reusable shopping bag is made of high-quality, heavy-duty canvas material that is designed to withstand daily wear and tear. The material is durable, and easy to clean, ensuring that the bags will last for years to come. 【Large Capacity】：This canvas tote bag measures 15’’ x 13’’ x 7’’ and is large enough to hold all your daily essentials and a small pocket (6’’ x 8’’) inside for personal items. The shoulder canvas tote reusable shopping bag features a spacious interior that can easily accommodate all your daily essentials, from groceries to books and other personal items. The bags are designed to be lightweight, making them comfortable to carry, even when fully loaded. 【Convenient Straps】: The reusable shopping canvas tote bag features two sturdy shoulder straps that allow you to carry the bag comfortably on your shoulder, comes with two sturdy handles that make it easy to carry by hand. The bags can be DIY'd in a variety of colors and patterns, allowing you to choose the one that best suits your personal style and preferences. 【Eco-Friendly】: These bags are an environmentally friendly alternative to disposable plastic bags, helping to reduce waste and protect the planet. They are reusable, washable, and designed to be used over and over again, making them a smart choice for those who want to make a positive impact on the environment. 【Washing Tips】: Unbleached cotton canvas shopping bags, The shrinkage rate after washing is about 5%. they are machine washable, re-washable grocery bags. Although they will wrinkle, they will not shrink like other bags, which is normal. Flatten it when wet, or iron it when dry. Must be hung to dry before ironing on high heat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512pYLJOg5L._AC_UL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINICE","source_asin":"B0BW3LCFSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW3LCFSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW3LCFSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
