window.products.push({"id":779630,"name":"A Bar Above Drinking Straws Cocktail Combo - Metal Straws for Home Bars - Stainless Steel Straws with Cleaning Tool & Dishwasher Bag - Cocktail Straws","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZYDqL4HkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Sip Your Drink With Ease — Crafting a refreshing cocktail often means using ice. Unfortunately, this can make it awkward to drink, especially when crushed. But with your new cocktail straw, you can savor every sip without a 2nd thought The Ultimate Sip Selection — Whether it's a lowball, highball, or a frozen cocktail, you'll have the right one for any drink. Ditch those useless plastic stir straws. With your choice of short, long, narrow, or wide reusable straws, you’ll be knocking back in style Quick Clean Up — After a night of fun, the last thing you want to worry about is scrubbing dishes. Getting to every nook and cranny of your reusable cocktail straws is a breeze with the cleaning tool. The dishwasher bag keeps your bar straws safe for thousands of cycles Gram Worthy Concoctions — This stainless steel straw will be your hottest drinking companion for the evening, whether you're pregaming or serving at a soiree. So make it a double, then stir and savor that Vodka Soda or White Russian. Your followers will thank you Toast To Style And Substance — With these reusable cocktail straws you'll corner the market for both style and taste. Drink your intoxicating mix the way you would at your favorite bar or establishment. At A Bar Above, we say Cheers to that!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZYDqL4HkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A Bar Above","source_asin":"B0B25R62N5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B25R62N5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B25R62N5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
