window.products.push({"id":779707,"name":"RAKLE Wine Glasses Set of 4 – Luxury Matte Black Wine Glasses – 16.5Oz Glass Set Ideal for Special Events, Themed Parties, Dinner Table, Everyday Use ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V+LgO2m6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Choice: As a self-respecting wine connoisseur, you surely understand the importance of serving your favorite wine from proper glasses, completing your drinking experience. The RAKLE wine drinking glasses are exactly what you need! Made with Premium Glass: Unlike similar products on the market, our wine glass is made using finest quality glass, with no lead or BPAs, being easy to wash, durable and guaranteed to last for many years! Unique Matte Design: Add a spectacular note to your table décor, kitchen or home bar with these refined red and white wine glasses, featuring a unique combination of matte bottom and semi-transparent top! Incredibly Versatile: Whether for white or red wine, as well as for your favorite cocktails, these retro glasses have wide applications. The convenient set of 4 is ideal for home use, special events, romantic evenings and more! Ideal Gift: The RAKLE colored glassware will make an excellent gift idea for your friends or loved ones. Perfect for housewarming parties, wedding registry, birthday, Christmas or other special occasions!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V+LgO2m6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RAKLE","source_asin":"B09X27TL9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X27TL9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X27TL9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":779708,"name":"Red Pomegranate Side Set/4 Pansy 6\" Two Tone Purple Bowls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j9jxHkZgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Bring your Garden indoors with this beautiful luminescent glass pansy bowl from Red Pomegranate Collection. Because its name means \"thought\", the Pansy was chosen as a symbol of Freethought and was used by many romantic poets in history. Even in Hamlet, Ophelia distributes flowers with the remark, \"There's pansies, that's for thoughts\". Therefore the legend has it that you could see the face of a loved one you think about on this flower. This brightly colored collection of Dinner, Salad and Desert plates are a perfect gift item in every presentation. Combine them with your fine China to perk up a table setting. Each piece is hand made using spun glass technique, once the glass has cooled down we hand decorate each one on the back of the glass starting with a hand applied patina paint which follows with gilding the silver, gold or copper leaves on the surface. Once the surface is cleaned from metal leaf residues, the item is heat cured we then layer organic pigment in steps to each glass piece by hand. As the metal layer soaks the paints in, all items are sealed with a special lacquer to assure its resistance to usage and heated for a final time to cure the item and penetrate all materials on the glass surface. Start to finish each one takes up to 3 hours to create. You can use this piece of art bowl as a decor piece on your coffee table, coin bowl, jeweler bowl or even a soap dish in your bath. You can also serve small bites of food as dessert, appetizers, cheese etc... in this bowl to decorate your table at your dinner party. Good size to use as a nuts bowl or personal tasting dishes as well. You can also use as a candle plate for your pillars. As you are serving food to eat best with your fingers; try to pour in some water, fresh flower petals, a little cologne and lemon juice to serve for each of your guests to clean their fingers after the dinner party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j9jxHkZgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Red Pomegranate","source_asin":"B0776YNQTY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0776YNQTY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0776YNQTY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":779709,"name":"Whippet Dog Figurine - Brindle & White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JWhF3uzNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each figurine in cast resin is carefully hand painted for that extra bit of realism. We boast a collection that offers The worlds most popular Dog breeds as well as its rarest! From Afghans to Yorkies, we've got The m all!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JWhF3uzNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Conversation Concepts","source_asin":"B000OBK9PQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000OBK9PQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000OBK9PQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":779710,"name":"Crosby & Taylor Pewter 2.5-inch Salt Dish with Bird's Nest Spoon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813c8NF3mML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This sweet little pewter dish brings to your table a charming way to serve salt, pepper, or other seasonings. It's cast in solid, lead-free American pewter, and comes with a delightful bird's nest spoon. Based in Oregon and formerly known as Tin Woodsman Pewter, artisan makers Crosby & Taylor have been casting their iconic pewter designs for well over 30 years. Everything is made in the USA using only the finest, lead-free American pewter, and each piece is cast and finished by hand. Deborah Chapman, who co-founded the company with her husband, Jim, continues to create designs that highlight the beauty and wonderful feel of genuine pewter. Her work has graced the kitchen of celebrity chefs, and her pewter embellishments continue to adorn the handmade pottery of Oregon Stoneware Studio. Build your collection of Crosby & Taylor pewter and discover the simple joy of tomorrow's heirlooms.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813c8NF3mML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crosby & Taylor","source_asin":"B07BMHXFP9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BMHXFP9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BMHXFP9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
