window.products.push({"id":779861,"name":"COLAMY Button Tufted Dining Chairs Set of 2, Accent Parsons Diner Chair Upholstered Fabric Dining Room Chairs Stylish Kitchen Chairs with Solid Wood L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l8-D5V2kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍻【Elegant & Modern Style】 This set of stylish dining chairs features diamond tufting detail with deep inset buttons to add a sense of elegance. Sleek and clean lines in modern style make it blend seamlessly with any home decor. These beautifully upholstered parsons chairs create a warm, inviting atmosphere for the dining room 🍻【Beautiful & Comfortable Fabric】 Our parsons dining chairs have soft padded cushion seats covered in linen fabric which is breathable and comfortable, and also easy to clean. You'll feel comfy and supportive sitting and relaxing in these kitchen room chairs with cushioned seats and high backs. It's also an absolute good choice for the living room or waiting room seats. 🍻【Ergonomic & High-Back Tufted Cushion】 The slightly curved high backrest with a roll-back top of these parsons chairs is ergonomically designed to fit your body shape, effectively protecting your waists and back and relieving the fatigue of a long time sitting. They will fit perfectly on your dining table. 🍻【Durable & Sturdy Kitchen Chairs】 The wood kitchen dining chairs are designed with heavy-duty solid rubberwood legs for optimum support to guarantee solidity and durability. The dining chairs are made of a wood frame with rubber legs in wulnut finish that can hold up to 250 lbs. Rubber feet on dining chair legs aim to prevent the floor from scratching. 🍻【Versatile Usage】 Come with two chairs, the set is ideal for family gatherings or dinner parties with friends. It can be widely used for daily dining or special events like meetings, wedding banquets, and celebrations, as a side chair or dining chair in the dining room, living room, meeting room, hotel, restaurants, or any other ceremonial decorations. 🍻【WORRY-FREE PURCHASE AND DEDICATED CUSTOMER SERVICE】-- we have one year warranty on the parts of the high back dining chairs. If any questions about the upholstered chairs, feel free to contact the manufacturer- COLAMY (contact info in user manual), we will reply to you within 24 hours. ❗❗❗Notice: the legs and screws are packed in a zippered compartment at the bottom of the chair seat cushion; each box contains 2 dining chairs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l8-D5V2kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COLAMY","source_asin":"B0C4SY8NB9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-779861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4SY8NB9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4SY8NB9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
